                    Confidential. No drafting information is on the source text, which was cleared
                    in S on January 10, 1966. The meeting was held in the Under Secretary’s
                    Conference Room. The source text is marked “Part III of V.” Chancellor Erhard
                    visited Washington December 19–21.</p>
